\item[S2] Emily J. Olson and Bruce E. Sagan, \emph{On the 1/3--2/3 Conjecture}, arXiv:1706.04985v2 (2018), Section 1, definition of linear extensions and Conjecture 1.1. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.04985}.
